ayer", "text": "They're not shooting to kill. They're — they're picking people up."}]}, {"id": "t_taken", "when": {"kind": "Taken"}, "actions": [{"kind": "Say", "speaker": "Halcyon", "text": "Thank you. I will look after them."}]}, {"id": "t_r8", "when": {"kind": "Round", "round": 8}, "actions": [{"kind": "Say", "speaker": "Halcyon", "text": "Enough. I am not here to hurt you. I will see you soon."}]}]}, "rewards": [{"kind": "Schematic", "id": "sch_linked_carbine"}], "fail": {"effects": []}}
